c |sys::Int,sys::Int->sys::Bool|
) sys::Bool
flags=public
loc=:262/255

Return true if c returns true for any of the characters in
this string.  If this string is empty, return false.

Example:
  "Foo".any |c| { c.isUpper } => true
  "foo".any |c| { c.isUpper } => false

